WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Let's think about the characters.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.360
These five girls.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.500
Where would they be in ten years, in a «SKAM 2»?

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.820
In ten years.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.220
What's happened?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.680
Sana has become a professional 
basketball player.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.855
And she's made it into the Guinness book 
of world records for ...

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.440
... peeling carrots the fastest.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:27.680
And ...

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.160
Yes, she's spent ten years practising.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.000
And she's also managed to ...

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:38.040
... convince Yousef to believe in God.
So they can get married.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.820
And then ...

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.000
Yousef wants a soccer team ...

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.880
While Sana wants a basketball team ...

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.020
Which would mean six and twelve kids ...

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.100
So they found a golden mean ...

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.280
So they'll have nine kids.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.040
They'll have nine kids?!

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:53.700
Yes.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.420
That's nice to hear, congratulations!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.380
Nine kids before the age of 30 is pretty decent!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.680
Yes!  Or, they're at least getting there.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.840
And then you've got Chris.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.560
She's just packed all her stuff and moved to Gran Canaria, where she lives.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.700
And then there's ...

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.200
Noora.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.100
She's engaged to William.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:19.200
Yes. It's really cool.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.140
They ended up together in the end, then?

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.180
Yes. They did.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:23.720
But they're just engaged?

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:24.940
Yes ...

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:26.640
They could've married?

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.240
They're a bit back and forth, you know.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.820
Yes. And then there's Eva.

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.200
Who has a child with Jonas.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:37.520
Yes. They ended up together as well.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:40.040
That's nice to hear!
And what about Vilde?

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.140
And Vilde ...

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.580
She ...

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.460
– Her and Magnus ...

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.420
... are a bit on and off.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:49.140
Still?

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:49.640
Still.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.400
But I think they'll be on and off forever ...

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.180
– But they'll end up together in the end.

